{"id":"taules-html","title":"Taules HTML","topic":"html","topicLabel":"HTML","tags":["aprendizaje","Html"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":66,"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Les taules serveixen per organitzar dades en files i columnes, com ara horaris o llistats. No s&#39;han d&#39;usar per dissenyar l&#39;estructura de la web, sinó només per a informació tabular. S&#39;estructuren amb <code>&lt;table&gt;</code>, files (<code>&lt;tr&gt;</code>), capçaleres (<code>&lt;th&gt;</code>) i cel·les de dades (<code>&lt;td&gt;</code>).</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">Html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">table</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>&gt;</span>Producte<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>&gt;</span>Preu<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>&gt;</span>Teclat<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>&gt;</span>\